ZeroTech’s Trace X 5-25X 56 mm pairs an illuminated FFP MRAD reticle with 0.1-MRAD turrets and a zero stop for long-range competitors.

Beretta and La Vallée Build a Shotgun You Can See Into

Beretta and watchmaker La Vallée have unveiled the SO10 Kronos, a one-off sidelock with sapphire-windowed sideplates built for Beretta’s 500th anniversary.

Chad Heckler Wins Limited Title at 2026 IPRF World Championship

Chad Heckler hit 171 of 200 shots to edge JC Robertson by two impacts and win the IPRF Limited world championship.

New: Springfield Armory Echelon Pro 9 mm Pistols

Springfield Armory’s Echelon Pro Comp brings an integral compensator, laser-sculpted grip texture and a steel magazine well to the 9 mm Echelon.

